    rfc:modality rfc:MUST ;
    rfc:predicate "Effective permission on a sponsor = union(visibility baseline §4.5.1, team-role permissions §2.5) ∩ grant set (AUTH-31). The union takes the max tier and keeps any orthogonal permission (`sponsor:analytics`, `deploy:*`) either side confers. Platform-owning org and SAVVI (§4.8) use the full set as the grant cap. One pure function (§4.11) answers point checks, lists, search, and deploy (AUTH-49)." ;
    rdfs:label "AUTH-14" ;
