    rfc:predicate "Teams are created and deleted by **org admins** of the owning org. Team admins manage existing teams (AUTH-8) but do not create or delete them. Deleting a team drops its sponsor assignments; if it was the only team assigned to a `private` sponsor, that sponsor remains visible only to org admins (AUTH-12). A team may be left with no team admin; org admins (AUTH-9) remain its management path." ;
